    {
      "id": "claim_fad1f7363a2b4691a559563b308efe4e",
      "statement": "The bron table enforces that a bron must be created inactive and can only be active when status is ready and voorwaarden_status is toegestaan, via the bron_active_policy_check and bron_ready_policy_check CHECK constraints; secret_ref is constrained to op/vault/trigger schemes so plaintext secrets are rejected at the DB layer even via direct DML.",
